@startuml C1_VVE_Execution_Process
title C1 – VVE Execution (High-Level Process)

start
:Operator opens in-progress VVE and reviews planned operations;
:SPA preloads planned tasks and populates execution form;
:Operator confirms or adjusts start/end times and resources;
:SPA sends PATCH /vves/{id}/operations to TodoApi;
:TodoApi validates token and forwards to OEM;
:OEM service validates operation references, persists execution updates, and sets statuses;
:OEM synchronises completion state with Operation Plan and emits audit events;
:OEM returns updated execution summary with warnings/deltas;
:TodoApi relays response to SPA;
:SPA updates progress indicators and variance badges;
stop

@enduml
